    image: /assets/img/featured-stories/best-glass-processing-company-india.jpg
    url: https://tprsglass.com/best-glass-processing-company-in-india/
  - title: "TPRS Unveils New Logo: A Fresh Look for a Sustainable Future"
    date: February 10, 2025
    views: "2K"
